Third-party components
======================

Shipped with the web app
------------------------

- Beetle VB (the libretro port of Mednafen's Virtual Boy emulator) — GPL-2.0-or-later.
  https://github.com/libretro/beetle-vb-libretro — Mednafen: https://mednafen.github.io/
- RetroArch (the libretro frontend the web core is built with) — GPL-3.0.
  https://github.com/libretro/RetroArch
- Emscripten runtime (compiled into the web core) — MIT. https://emscripten.org/
- EmulatorJS (the loader, page glue and localization in public/data/) — GPL-3.0.
  https://github.com/EmulatorJS/EmulatorJS
  Bundled with it, unchanged:
  - nipplejs (public/data/src/vendor/nipplejs.js) — MIT.
    https://github.com/yoannmoinet/nipplejs
  - Socket.IO client 4.8.1 (public/data/src/vendor/socket.io.min.js) — MIT,
    (c) 2014-2024 Guillermo Rauch. https://github.com/socketio/socket.io
  - libunrar-js (public/data/compression/libunrar.*), an Emscripten port of RARLAB's unRAR
    source — under the unRAR licence, which allows free use and redistribution but forbids
    using the code to re-create the RAR compression algorithm. It is not a GPL licence; it
    is shipped as a separate file that EmulatorJS loads only to open .rar archives.
    https://github.com/tnikolai2/libunrar-js — https://www.rarlab.com/
  - extract7z.js and extractzip.js (public/data/compression/) — archive extractors as
    distributed with EmulatorJS; EmulatorJS does not document their origin.
- JSZip — MIT or GPL-3.0 (dual licensed). https://github.com/Stuk/jszip
- fflate — MIT. https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate

Fonts (loaded from Google Fonts, not shipped)
---------------------------------------------

- Outfit — SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Outfit
- IBM Plex Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://github.com/IBM/plex

Built into the native PC player (native/)
-----------------------------------------

- Beetle VB — GPL-2.0-or-later (as above).
- SDL2 — zlib licence. https://www.libsdl.org/
- miniz 3.0.2 — MIT. https://github.com/richgel999/miniz
- nlohmann/json 3.11.3 — MIT. https://github.com/nlohmann/json
- stb_image — MIT or public domain (your choice). https://github.com/nothings/stb

miniz, nlohmann/json and stb_image are downloaded at build time (native/cmake/Deps.cmake), not
stored in this repository.


Source of the bundled emulator core
===================================

public/data/cores/beetle_vb-wasm.data is built from:

- Beetle VB at commit f94d3e8 and RetroArch at commit ed32657, with Emscripten 3.1.74,
- plus the patches in patches/,

by scripts/build-core.sh, which reproduces the shipped file bit for bit
(docs/core/core-build.md).


